WEBVTT

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.180
All right.

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:06.650
Back!

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:10.820
You three are under arrest.

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:12.320
But we can't stop now.

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:13.630
Cordae's in danger.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:14.860
Oh yeah?

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:16.910
I've heard that one before.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:18.440
Take them away, boys.

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:21.590
I tell you, Ms. Poitier is chasing a man to try to kill her.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:22.780
That's on the square.

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:24.020
We won't try to get away.

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:25.100
All right.

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:26.220
Which way to go?

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:26.860
I'll show you.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.500
Go perish, all traitors.

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:07.070
Ain't much of a wound.

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:08.600
Better take her home.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:10.130
I'll take care of that.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:12.350
You three fellows are going back right now.

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:13.730
Colonel Duval's orders.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:19.240
I've already warned you three against stirring up trouble with Arabs,

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.840
and I've just had another complaint against you.

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:25.570
But, Colonel, we were only trying to run down El Chatan.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:27.870
He's the one that's really causing all the trouble.

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:28.370
That's right.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:29.330
That's for me to decide.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.120
You three will be confined to the portal.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:34.290
Happy guard duty.

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:35.500
Indefinitely.

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:37.810
Report to the sergeant of the guard.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:49.260
Alec!

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.940
I'll bet my last cent in our hunch is price.

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:54.620
Duval is working with El Shaitan.

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:57.140
Yeah, maybe he's El Shaitan himself.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.000
Mr. Rackin, to see you, sir.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:01.760
Join in.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:06.360
Your reckons this terrible thing has happened.

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:07.500
El Chaitan is stuck again.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.500
This time, my clerk, Banyasov, has been murdered.

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:15.530
Really, Mr. Rackin, I'm surprised that you believe all these fairy stories about El Chaitan.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.460
There isn't any such person.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:21.360
I assure you, Colonel Duvall, that El Chaitan, this devil's circle, really exists.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:23.380
The devil's circle?

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:25.960
Yes, El Chaitan's secret society.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.030
They hold their meetings in this very town.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:29.980
Where did...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.340
Where did you get so much information about El Chaitan?

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:42.230
Men have heard and seen before they died, they talked.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:47.650
In that case, Mr. Atkin, hadn't you better be careful what you say?

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:53.560
Or you too may become a victim of El Chaitan and the Devil's Circle.

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:07.740
The devil's circle is complete.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.670
El Shaitan is here.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:25.710
Our shipment of arms and ammunition,

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:27.610
which was captured by Colonel Duval,

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:29.910
is now stored in the lead.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:34.600
Tonight, we strike to recover it.

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:38.060
Master, those guns are guarded by the post right from the legion.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:43.420
Oh, I will see to it. The troops are not there tonight.

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:50.910
We shall not only recover our guns, but at the same time, rid ourselves of our enemy, Tom Wayne.

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:03.830
The three musketeers haven't forgotten you, Tom.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:08.550
Here, I got this from the colonel's kitchen.

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:09.760
For you.

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:11.180
Thanks, Ned.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.280
Here, have some of it yourself.

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:15.970
Well, I'll just take a little nibble.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.550
Where are the troops going?

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:35.410
Colonel Duval has ordered the whole regiment out on a mysterious expedition.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:38.340
There's hardly enough men left to do guard duty.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:45.010
You'd be in a tough spot if anything happened with the regiment, it was.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:51.000
Yeah, I'll have to get to another one.

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:52.360
Oh, that's all right.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:23.610
Want to get shot with what you're putting around this time of night?

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:26.750
I had to wait until it was dark to get this for Tom.

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:29.090
But you slipped him one this afternoon, didn't you?

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:29.970
Yeah, but...

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.100
I've forgotten that of myself.

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:33.100
Well, hurry up.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:34.380
You're in wrong enough already.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:03.940
Come quick! It's an either side. Arabs, hundreds of them!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.930
Well, he was here a minute ago.

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:11.570
Look!

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:45.250
