00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:50.580
We gotta save Tom!

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.080
I thought that you had promised me.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.200
Hide yourself.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.340
Tom's got to get out of here.

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:33.700
Wait.

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:40.000
You run into the car.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.320
I'm going to search Duval's office before I leave.

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:43.460
I got you.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:44.900
We think he's working with us.

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:48.260
Maybe I can find some evidence to prove that he is El Cheytan.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:54.430
Got away with the guns, Colonel.

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:07.850
You fellas better get back to your post.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.620
Pursuit car coming back. They must have caught the thieves.

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:15.310
Thank you.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:23.720
captured the truck and the driver, sir, but it was empty.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:25.040
Bulls.

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:27.200
Let one arrow lead you on a wild goose chase.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:28.820
And the rest of them got away with a gun.

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:31.580
Thank you.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:11:59.740
more

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:08.550
to carry out my order our cause is still in danger master we recovered the arms

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:19.210
and ammunition yes but you allowed our enemy wing to escape what's that why

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:44.260
There he goes. Master, he has disappeared.

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:52.970
Drop your gun, Lieutenant Wayne. You have nothing to fear from me.

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:54.970
He must not get away.

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:05.870
